<title>JAPAN: US Fed's Greenspan to visit Japan in mid-Nov - BOJ.</title>
<headline>US Fed's Greenspan to visit Japan in mid-Nov - BOJ.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Federal Reserve Chairman Alan Greenspan will come to Japan in mid-November and meet Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita, a BOJ spokesman said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The spokesman said he had no further details at present on Greenspan's schedule or the purpose of the planned visit.</p>
</text>
